<title>USA: PSE says to delist Good Ideas Enterprises.</title>
<headline>PSE says to delist Good Ideas Enterprises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Wednesday it suspended trading in the common stock of Good Ideas Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>The exchange said the company failed to comply with its listing maintenance requirements for share bid price and market value.</p>
<p>It said delisting is subject to Securities and Exchange Commission approval.</p>
<p>The stock ended at 5/16 Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
